linos: Hey wait!
[signal arg="player_move_to_target"]
[signal arg="player_face_npc"]

linos: I don't think I've seen you around here before.
linos: You must be new here, huh?
linos: Well, welcome to [color=#4F6B45]Atomonia[/color]. I'm Linos.
linos: It's nice to meet you.
- Nice to meet you too..
	linos: Likewise!
	linos: This village is located south east of Chemistria.
	linos: So, you're new around here?
- Where am I?
	linos: This village is located south east of Chemistria.
	linos: So, you're new around here?
- What's going on?
	linos: This village is located south east of Chemistria.
	linos: Hmm? Are you ok stranger?
	linos: You don't seem to be feeling fine.
	linos: Are you new around here?
linos: You look like you haven't been here before.
linos: Have you been to Atomonia before?
- No, never.
	linos: I thought so.
- I don't think so.
	linos: Heh. That explains the confused look.
- I'm not sure.
	linos: Fair enough.
linos: Wait... Where did you came from?
[signal arg="emote:linos:curious"]
linos: You came out on that direction right?
linos: That path leads to a cliff...
linos: How could anyone have come from there without entering through this path?
linos: Unless....
Player: Unless what??
[signal arg="emote:linos:shocked"]
linos: You're an intruder! You must be planning to harm our village!
Player: WHAT!? Wait no...
Player: Listen... I am just as clueless as you are about all of this..
Player: First of all, I don't even know Atomonia.
Player: Second, I don't even know where Chemistria is!
Player: Is that even a real place??
linos: What?
linos: Of course Chemistria is real!
linos: What kind of question is that?
Player: I don't know...
Player: I don't know where I am, I don't know how I got here, and now you're telling me I'm in a place I've never even heard of!
linos: ...
linos: You really don't know anything, do you?
Player: Yeah... And I'm scared. I want to go back!
linos: That is something even I don't know how to help you with...
linos: We don't know how you got here, and why.
linos: Atleast tell me where are you from? Maybe from a different continent perhaps?
Player: I'm from Philippines...
linos: Phili... what??
Player: PHILIPPINES! A country I live in. You know,a small country on planet Earth.
linos: Earth? Never heard of Philippines as a country and Earth as a planet my friend..
linos: Our planet is called Atherion...
Player: Atherion?
Player: You're joking right??
linos: Why would I lie about this? Atomonia is my village, Chemistria is my country and Atherion is my planet.
Player: (Ohhh please no...)
linos: You really don't know anything about this place, do you?
Player: Not a single thing...
linos: Well...
linos: I suppose that's going to make things a little complicated.
Player: Yeah. A LOT.
[signal arg="emote:linos:worried"]
linos: But we'll figure something out.
[signal arg="atomon_walk"]
[wait time="2.0"]
Player: ........
Player: Uh........
Player: What is that?
linos: What?
Player: That thing!
linos: Oh.
linos: That's Hydrubbie.
linos: A Hydrogen Atomon.
Player: An... Atomon?
linos: Yeah.
Player: What is an Atomon? And Hydrogen? As in the element?
linos: Oh, right.
[signal arg="emote:linos:giggle"]
linos: I keep forgetting you're not from around here.
linos: Atomons are creatures that live all across Atherion.
Player: Like animals?
linos: In a way.
linos: But they're quite different from ordinary animals.
Player: Yeah.. I can totally see that..
linos: Every Atomon is associated with an element.
linos: Hydrogen, Oxygen, Carbon, Iron...
linos: You know, the elements.
Player: Yeah I know them of course. Atleast they are named the same here from my world.
Player: But you're telling me those are creatures? Here?
linos: Well, they're Atomons.
Player: So that thing that just walked past us...
linos: That's a Hydrogen Atomon.
Player: And it just... walks around the village?
linos: This one does.
linos: It's actually a stray.
linos: It started wandering around Atomonia some time ago.
linos: Nobody really knows where it came from.
linos: But it never caused any trouble.
linos: The villagers got used to seeing it around, so we just let it stay.
Player: So it's basically part of the village now?
linos: Pretty much.
Player: That's actually kind of cute.
linos: You're already getting along with Hydrubbie.
Player: I wouldn't go that far.
linos: Anyway, you'll probably be seeing a lot more of them.
Player: Somehow, I don't think that's going to make this place any less confusing.
linos: You'll get used to it.
Player: I hope so.
Player: But I still have so many questions about Atomons.
linos: Hmm...
linos: Actually, I know someone who might be able to help.
linos: There's someone in the village who knows quite a lot about Atomons.
linos: He's probably the best person to ask if you want to understand them better.
Player: Where can I find him?
linos: He should be around Atomonia somewhere.
linos: Pay him a visit when you get the chance.
Player: Alright. I guess I could start there.
linos: Good luck.
linos: And don't worry. He'll probably have plenty to tell you.
[signal arg="quest_accept:quest_chain_001"]